Zero point energy                ...      0.26223721 Eh     164.56 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01125579 Eh       7.06 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
